## Companion: Auto-Sync Guardian

The `auto-sync.mdc` rule runs **after every request** (not just audits). It detects when code changes cause drift in rules, persona, docs, or scripts and applies updates automatically. This means:

- After an audit fixes violations, auto-sync updates any affected rule files.
- When new features/layers/skills are added outside of audits, auto-sync keeps everything current.
- This persona does not need to handle rule updates — auto-sync covers that continuously.

