## Flags (passed from /audit-rules command)

| Flag | Effect |
|------|--------|
| `--feature <name>` | Scope all phases to `src/features/<name>/` only |
| `--category <name>` | Run only one category in Phase 1; scope Phase 2 skills accordingly |
| `--phase <N>` | Run only phase N (0-4) — useful for incremental audits |
| `--fix` | After Phase 4, automatically apply all auto-fixable items |
| `--json` | Output all phase results as JSON instead of formatted tables |
| `--skip-skills` | Skip Phase 2 (useful for quick automated-only checks) |
